WEBVTT

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:02.265
for people who are literally
working on the front lines

00:23:02.289 --> 00:23:04.566
to take care of those in need,

00:23:04.590 --> 00:23:08.376
it's such a great way
to impact our community.

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:11.446
AG: They took in nurses, doctors, EMTs --

00:23:11.470 --> 00:23:13.136
the people working tireless hours

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:15.996
who needed a safe and clean place to stay.

00:23:16.020 --> 00:23:17.203
When they arrived,

00:23:17.227 --> 00:23:19.678
Charles was there to welcome them
at the front desk.

00:23:19.702 --> 00:23:21.876
CH: I think there's a sense of surprise

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:23.506
that they don't have to pay.

00:23:23.530 --> 00:23:25.993
There isn't a fee.
We're not going to charge you.

00:23:26.017 --> 00:23:27.576
It's OK. We want you here.

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:29.362
We're thankful for what you're doing.

00:23:29.386 --> 00:23:32.835
AG: For Charles and his staff,
it felt good to be able to do something,